          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refractory, basic, packed, at plant
na;
Synonyms: Keramik, Ofenausmauerung, ceramics, brick lining of a furnace; 
UUID: e1da5b46-06a9-355e-a240-76deff4922ce
Includes the whole manufacturing process, internal processes (transport, etc.), packing and infrastructure. No administration is included.; Geography: German, European and global modules used as proxy. Manufacturing data from Germany for German module. Switzerland is not producing any basic refractories.
